div.p:
. . . a working group, under the leadership of Mr. Jorden and Mr. Kubisch, would
                    prepare a comprehensive paper on Chile’s economic and military needs over the
                    short, middle, and long term;

note.p:
Source: National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, NSC
                    Institutional Files (H-Files), Box H–94, WSAG Meeting, Chile, 9/14/73. Secret;
                    Nodis. This meeting took place in the White House Situation Room.
